Scenario "review decider returns false for small invoices"
When I run "../examples/01_review_decider.dvl" method "decide_review" with [8000]
Then run should succeed
Then return value should equal false
Then review_needed should equal false

Scenario "payroll calculator multiplies hours by rate"
When I run "../examples/02_payroll_calculator.dvl" method "calculate_wages" with [40, 25]
Then run should succeed
Then return value should equal 1000
Then wages should equal 1000

Scenario "invoice reviewer escalates large invoices"
When I run "../examples/04_invoice_reviewer.dvl" method "review_invoice" with [12000]
Then run should succeed
Then return value should equal "priority"
Then review_needed should equal true
Then escalation_label should equal "priority"
